#: backgnd.cpp:118
msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "Sicribanne"

#: backgnd.cpp:124
msgid "&Common background"
msgstr "Fond &comon inte les scribannes"

#: backgnd.cpp:127
msgid ""
"Choose the desktop whose background you want to modify. If you want the same "
"background settings to be applied to all desktops, check the \"Common "
"Background\" option, and this list will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Tchoezixhoz li scribanne ki vos vloz candjî si fond. Si vos vloz l' minme "
"apontiaedje do fond po tos les scribannes, clitchîz l' tchuze «Fond comon "
"inte les scribannes», eyet cisse djivêye chal serè-st essoctêye."

#: backgnd.cpp:131
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to have the same background settings for all "
"desktops. If this option is not checked, the background settings can be "
"customized for each desktop."
msgstr ""
"Clitchîz cisse tchuze chal si vos vloz li minme apontiaedje do fond po tos "
"les scribannes. Si cisse tchuze chal n' est nén clitcheye, les "
"apontiaedjes do fond polèt esse diferins po tchaeke sicribanne."

#: backgnd.cpp:144
msgid ""
"In this monitor, you can preview how your settings will look like on a "
"\"real\" desktop."
msgstr ""
"Dins cisse waitroûle chal, vos ploz vey kimint ki vos apontiaedjes vont "
"esse on côp k' i sront metous en alaedje sol sicribanne."

#: backgnd.cpp:163
msgid "&Background"
msgstr "&Fond"

#: backgnd.cpp:168 bgdialogs.cpp:672
msgid "&Mode:"
msgstr "&Môde:"

#: backgnd.cpp:181
msgid ""
"You can select the manner in which the background is painted. The choices "
"are: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Flat:</em> Use a solid color (\"Color 1\").</li> "
"<li><em>Pattern:</em>"
" Use a two-color pattern. Click \"Setup\" to choose the pattern.</li> "
"<li><em>Gradients:</em> Blend two colors using a predefined gradient "
"(horizontal, vertical, etc.).</li> "
"<li><em>Program:</em> Use an application which paints the background, for "
"example, with a day/night map of the world that is refreshed periodically. "
"Click \"Setup\" to select and configure the program.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Vos ploz tchoezi l' manire di gålioter li fond del waitroûle.Les tchuzes "
"sont: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Plat:</em> Ene seule solide coleur («Coleur 1»).</li> "
"<li><em>Patron:</em> On patron avou deus coleurs. Clitchîz so "
"«Apontiaedje» po tchoezi l' patron.</li> "
"<li><em>Dégradés:</em> Maxhaedje di deus coleurs shuvant on degradé dné "
"(di coûtchî, d' astampé, evnd.).</li> "
"<li><em>Programe:</em> On programe est eployî po rimpli l' fond del "
"waitroûle, par egzimpe, avou ene mape e tins reyel del daegn. Clitchîz so "
"«Apontiaedje» po tchoezi eyet apontyî li programe.</li></ul>"

#: backgnd.cpp:192
msgid "Color &1:"
msgstr "Coleur &1:"

#: backgnd.cpp:200
msgid "Click to choose a color."
msgstr "Clitchîz po tchoezi ene coleur."

#: backgnd.cpp:202
msgid "Color &2:"
msgstr "Coleur &2:"

#: backgnd.cpp:210
msgid ""
"Click to choose a second color. If the background mode does not require a "
"second color, this button is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Clitchîz po tchoezi ene deujhinme coleur. Si l' môde pol fond n' a nén "
"mezåjhe d' ene deujhinme coleur, ci boton chal est dismetou."

#: backgnd.cpp:213
msgid "&Setup..."
msgstr "A&pontiaedje..."

#: backgnd.cpp:216
msgid ""
"If the background mode you selected has additional options to configure, "
"click here."
msgstr ""
"Si l' môde do fond ki vos avoz tchoezi a des ôtes tchuzes po-z apontyî, "
"clitchîz chal."

#: backgnd.cpp:221
msgid "&Wallpaper"
msgstr "&Tapisreye"

#: backgnd.cpp:230
msgid ""
"If you check this option, you can choose a set of graphic files to be used "
"as wallpaper, one at a time, for an interval ranging from 1 minute to 4 "
"hours. You can also choose to have the graphics selected at random or in the "
"order you specified them."
msgstr ""
"Si vos clitchîz cisse tchuze chal, vos ploz tchoezi on eshonna di fitchîs "
"grafikes po ls eployî come tapisreye, onk après l' ôte, avou des "
"tårdjaedjes po candjî ki polèt aler di 1 munute a 4 eures. Vos ploz ossu "
"tchoezi d' aveur les imådjes ki s' shuvèt a l' astcheyance oudonbén "
"dins l' ôre ki vos avoz dné."

#: backgnd.cpp:237
msgid "&No wallpaper"
msgstr "&Nole imådje"

#: backgnd.cpp:238
msgid "&Single wallpaper"
msgstr "&Ene seule imådje"

#: backgnd.cpp:239
msgid "&Multiple wallpapers"
msgstr "&Sacwantès imådjes"

#: backgnd.cpp:245
msgid "Mod&e:"
msgstr "&Môde:"

#: backgnd.cpp:252
msgid ""
"You can have a wallpaper (based on a graphic) on top of your background. You "
"can choose one of the following methods for displaying the wallpaper: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Centered:</em> Center the graphic on the desktop.</li> "
"<li><em>Tiled:</em> Tile the graphic beginning at the top left of the "
"desktop, so the background is totally covered up.</li> "
"<li><em>Center Tiled:</em> Center the graphic on the desktop, and then tile "
"around it so that the background is totally covered up.</li> "
"<li><em>Centered Maxpect:</em> Magnify the graphic without distorting it "
"until it fills either the width or height of the desktop, and then center it "
"on the desktop.</li> "
"<li><em>Scaled:</em> Magnify the graphic, distorting it if necessary, until "
"the entire desktop is covered.</li> "
"<li><em>Centered Auto Fit:</em>"
" If the wallpaper fits the desktop, this mode works like Centered. If the "
"wallpaper is larger than the desktop, it's scalled down to fit while keeping "
"the aspect ratio.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Vos ploz aveur ene tapisreye (avou ene imådje) sol fond del waitroûle. Vos "
"ploz tchoezi ene des metôdes shuvantes pol håynaedje di l' imådje: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Å mitan:</em> Mete l' imådje å mitan del waitroûle.</li> "
"<li><em>A schaeyes:</em> Rimpli l' waitroûle avou les imådjes a môde di "
"schaeyes, tot cminçant å dzeur a hintche.</li>."
"<li><em>Å mitan et a schaeyes:</em> Rimpli l' waitroûle a môde di "
"schaeyes, mins tot cminçant på cinte del waitroûle.</li> "
"<li><em>Å mitan et å pus grand:</em>"
" Mete l' imådje å pus grand possibe sol waitroûle, mins tot wårdant les "
"proporcions, eyet mete l' imådje å cinte.</li> "
"<li><em>Al schåle:</em> Mete l' imådje al schåle po l' agrandi ou "
"l' raptiti po forrimpli li waitroûle, minme s' i fåt distoide les "
"proporcions del imådje.</li> "
"<li><em>Å mitan et otorimplixhaedje:</em> Si l' tapisreye a djusse li "
"grandeu del waitroûle, ci môde chal fwait li minme ki «Å mitan». Si "
"l' imådje est pus grande, ele est metowe al schåle disk' a rimpli "
"l' waitroûle, et tot wårdant les proporcions.</li></ul>"

#: backgnd.cpp:270
msgid "&Wallpaper:"
msgstr "&Imådje:"

#: backgnd.cpp:279
msgid "Click to choose the graphic you want to use as wallpaper."
msgstr "Clitchîz po tchoezi l' imådje ki vos vloz eployî come tapisreye."

#: backgnd.cpp:282 bgdialogs.cpp:553
msgid "&Browse..."
msgstr "&Foyter..."

#: backgnd.cpp:285
msgid ""
"If the graphic you want is not in a standard directory, you can still find "
"it by clicking here."
msgstr ""
"Si l' imådje ki vos vloz n' est nén dins on ridant standård, vos "
"l' poloz tot l' minme aler cweri tot clitchant chal."

#: backgnd.cpp:288
msgid "S&etup Multiple..."
msgstr "Apontia&edje multipe..."

#: backgnd.cpp:294
msgid ""
"Click here to select graphics to be used for wallpaper, and to configure "
"other options."
msgstr ""
"Clitchîz chal po tchoezi les imådjes a-z eployî pol tapisreye, eyet po-z "
"apontyî les ôtès tchuzes."

#: backgnd.cpp:299
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Sipepieus"

#: backgnd.cpp:304
msgid "Ble&nding:"
msgstr ""

#: backgnd.cpp:312
msgid ""
"If you have selected to use wallpaper, you can choose various methods of "
"blending the background colors and patterns with the wallpaper. The default "
"option, \"No Blending\", means that the wallpaper simply obscures the "
"background below."
msgstr ""

#: backgnd.cpp:319
msgid "Balance:"
msgstr ""

#: backgnd.cpp:327
msgid ""
"You can use this slider to control the degree of blending. You can "
"experiment by moving the slider and looking at the effects in the preview "
"image above."
msgstr ""

#: backgnd.cpp:330
msgid "R&everse"
msgstr "Å&rvier"

#: backgnd.cpp:335
msgid ""
"For some types of blending, you can reverse the background and wallpaper "
"layers by checking this option."
msgstr ""

#: backgnd.cpp:338
msgid "&Limit pixmap cache"
msgstr "&Limiter li muchete des imådjes"

#: backgnd.cpp:339
msgid ""
"Checking this box limits the amount of memory that KDE will use to save "
"pixmap (raster graphics). It is advisable to do this, especially if you do "
"not have a lot of memory."
msgstr ""

#: backgnd.cpp:344
msgid "Cache &size:"
msgstr "&Grandeu del muchete:"

#: backgnd.cpp:349
msgid " KB"
msgstr " Ko"

#: backgnd.cpp:354
msgid ""
"In this box you can enter how much memory KDE should use for caching pixmaps "
"for faster access."
msgstr ""
"Dins cisse boesse chal vos ploz mete kibén d' memwere KDE pout eployî pol "
"muchete des imådjes, po on accès pus roed."

